OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother day of frequent
OL,6,Fshowers, heavy at times, and some
OL,7,Fsunny intervals. A windy day with west
OL,8,Fto northwesterly gales at first over
OL,9,FIsles and western coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy in the evening with
OL,12,Ffrequent showers at first, these
OL,13,Fbecoming lighter and more isolated
OL,14,Fthrough the evening and overnight,
OL,15,Fallowing some clear spells to develop.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA few light showers around at
OL,18,Ffirst. Otherwise a dry day with sunny
OL,19,Fspells and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
