OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Monday with patchy rain. Early rain
OL,7,Fclearing on Tuesday then sunshine and
OL,8,Fblustery showers. Cloudy and windy on
OL,9,FWednesday with persistent and
OL,10,Foccasionally heavy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
